WEBVTT

00:04:59.042 --> 00:05:02.934
Democrats and Republicans,
labor and conservatives,

00:05:02.958 --> 00:05:06.667
left and right all became,
broadly, Keynesian.

00:05:07.708 --> 00:05:10.226
Then, when Keynesianism ran into trouble

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.309
in the 1970s,

00:05:12.333 --> 00:05:16.684
the neoliberals, people like
Friedrich Hayek and Milton Friedman,

00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:20.059
came forward with
their new restoration story,

00:05:20.083 --> 00:05:21.625
and it went something like this.

00:05:22.917 --> 00:05:24.518
You'll never guess what's coming.

00:05:24.542 --> 00:05:25.809
(Laughter)

00:05:25.833 --> 00:05:28.643
Disorder afflicts the land!

00:05:28.667 --> 00:05:33.184
Caused by the powerful
and nefarious forces